cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it as below. Please also cite the criteria/metrics versions you used (see CHANGELOG.md)."
title: "medeval-lab: an independent, open-source Medical AI Evaluation Lab"
abstract: >-
  A research methods toolkit for auditing medical benchmark item integrity,
  defining literature-traced evaluation criteria and metrics, testing LLM judges
  as measurement instruments, and reporting reliability statistics honestly.
  medeval-lab is a research tool, not a medical device: it has no clinical
  validation and no clinician reference standard. Small-sample results are
  exploratory.
version: 0.6.0
